              "type": "math",
              "latex": "\\left(2-\\frac{3n}{m}+\\frac{9n^2-2m^2}{m^2+2mn}\\right)\\div\\left(\\frac{1}{m}-\\frac{1}{m-2n-\\frac{4n^2}{m+n}}\\right)",
